{"seq":2,"slug":"geo-holdout-growth","title":"geo holdout 衡量渠道增量","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/global-user-growth-attribution/incremental-growth/geo-holdout-growth","wordCount":2736,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"geo-holdout-衡量渠道增量\">geo holdout 衡量渠道增量</h1><p>用户级随机分流在广告场景里几乎做不到——平台不会让你随机屏蔽一半受众的广告位。地理分区对照实验（geo holdout，也叫 geo experiment、region-based holdout）绕开了这个限制：<strong>用市场代替用户做随机化单位</strong>。在一个国家内部选一批地理区域作为对照组，停止或降低那里的投放，其余区域照常，然后比较两组的差异。这篇文章讲怎么设计和执行这个实验，以及它在什么时候会给出错误答案。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-为什么必须是地理分区\">核心概念：为什么必须是地理分区</h2><p>随机对照实验的三个要素是随机化、对照组、以及可比的单位。广告投放场景的特殊约束是：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>约束</th>\n<th>用户级随机</th>\n<th>地理级随机</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>平台是否支持</td>\n<td>多数不支持（无法只屏蔽部分用户的广告）</td>\n<td>支持（可按地区设预算或排除）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>溢出效应</td>\n<td>同住一个家庭/同一设备可能互相影响</td>\n<td>地区间溢出较小（除相邻区域通勤）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>样本量</td>\n<td>大</td>\n<td>小（可选区域数量有限）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>实施成本</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>高（需要平台、财务、运营配合）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>结论粒度</td>\n<td>细</td>\n<td>粗（只能给出地区级或国家级增量）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>地理分区之所以被广泛使用，是因为它是<strong>在平台约束下唯一能真正制造反事实的方法</strong>。用户的广告展示不能随机抑制，但平台设置里的地区排除、地区预算调整是标准功能。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[选定的市场地理单元池] --&gt; B[按历史特征匹配]&#10;    B --&gt; C[分为处理组与对照组]&#10;    C --&gt; D[处理组: 正常或加大投放]&#10;    C --&gt; E[对照组: 停止或大幅降低投放]&#10;    D --&gt; F[观测转化/新客/收入]&#10;    E --&gt; F&#10;    F --&gt; G[差分估计: 处理组增量 vs 对照组]&#10;    G --&gt; H[增量 = 总差异 - 自然增长与季节性]&#10;    H --&gt; I[增量 CAC]\">graph TD\n    A[选定的市场地理单元池] --&gt; B[按历史特征匹配]\n    B --&gt; C[分为处理组与对照组]\n    C --&gt; D[处理组: 正常或加大投放]\n    C --&gt; E[对照组: 停止或大幅降低投放]\n    D --&gt; F[观测转化/新客/收入]\n    E --&gt; F\n    F --&gt; G[差分估计: 处理组增量 vs 对照组]\n    G --&gt; H[增量 = 总差异 - 自然增长与季节性]\n    H --&gt; I[增量 CAC]</pre><p>实验的核心逻辑是差分：处理组的变化里，既包含投放的效果，也包含自然增长与季节性。<strong>对照组的作用就是量出后者</strong>。没有对照组时，你只能拿处理组和历史同期比，而历史同期无法反映当年的竞品动作、平台流量变化、宏观经济波动。</p>\n<h2 id=\"设计-五个必须做对的决策\">设计：五个必须做对的决策</h2><p><strong>决策一，地理单元的选择粒度。</strong> 可选单位从大到小：国家级、一级行政区（州/省）、城市圈、邮编区。粒度越细，样本越多、统计功效越高，但溢出效应与匹配难度越大。跨境场景中，<strong>多数实验以国家级或一级行政区为单元</strong>——因为跨境投放的预算通常在国家级或市场级配置。粒度选择要与平台的配置能力对齐：平台只能按国家排除时，再细的划分也无法实施。</p>\n<p><strong>决策二，对照组规模。</strong> 经验值是 10%–20% 的投放量进入对照组。太小则统计功效不足，太大则损失的业务量过多、实验成本过高。若可选区域少（比如只有 6 个市场），对照组可能需要占到三分之一甚至一半，这时要接受更高的业务代价。</p>\n<p><strong>决策三，匹配方式。</strong> 处理组与对照组必须在实验前就相似。两种做法：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>配对设计</strong>：把地理单元按历史转化量、收入、人口规模、渠道结构配对，每对中随机指派一个进处理组、一个进对照组。</li>\n<li><strong>分层随机</strong>：按若干特征分层后在各层内随机分配。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>配对设计的优点是可比性容易验证（每对的两个成员历史曲线应当接近），缺点是可选配对数量受限。判断可比性的可视化方法是画两组在实验前 4–8 周的转化量曲线，<strong>预处理期曲线应当平行</strong>——这是差分估计成立的前提。</p>\n<p><strong>决策四，实验周期。</strong> 周期要覆盖完整的转化周期与周期性波动：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>因素</th>\n<th>对周期的影响</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>转化周期</td>\n<td>至少覆盖所选归因窗口的 1–2 倍</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>周内波动</td>\n<td>必须是整周（≥2 周）以避免工作日/周末差异</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>月度/季节性</td>\n<td>最好覆盖 4–8 周，跨过月末结算与月初效应</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>广告平台学习期</td>\n<td>预算调整后通常需要 1–2 周才稳定</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>最低实践标准是 4 周，常见是 6–8 周。</strong> 短于 4 周的实验极容易被周内波动与平台学习期污染。</p>\n<p><strong>决策五，处理强度的选择。</strong> 是&quot;完全停投&quot;还是&quot;大幅降投（例如降到 20%）&quot;？完全停投的效应最大、最容易检出，但业务损失大且可能触发平台账号的异常；降投的效应小但业务损失可控。跨境场景的常见折中是<strong>降到 10%–20%</strong>，同时保证处理强度足够使效应高于噪声。</p>\n<h2 id=\"估计-差分与它的假设\">估计：差分与它的假设</h2><p>最简单也最常用的估计量是差分中的差分（difference-in-differences）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>τ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>Y</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mtext>treat,post</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>Y</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mtext>treat,pre</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>Y</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mtext>ctrl,post</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>Y</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mtext>ctrl,pre</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{\\tau} = (\\bar{Y}_{\\text{treat,post}} - \\bar{Y}_{\\text{treat,pre}}) - (\\bar{Y}_{\\text{ctrl,post}} - \\bar{Y}_{\\text{ctrl,pre}})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2222em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1062em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8201em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">treat,post</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1062em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8201em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">treat,pre</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1062em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8201em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">ctrl,post</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1062em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8201em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">ctrl,pre</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>它的核心假设是<strong>平行趋势假设</strong>：若无干预，处理组与对照组的变化趋势相同。这个假设不能检验（因为处理组在实验期确实被干预了），但可以用实验前的数据做间接验证——如果实验前两组曲线已经发散，实验后的结论就不可信。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[实验前 4-8 周] --&gt; B[画两组曲线]&#10;    B --&gt; C{曲线平行?}&#10;    C --&gt;|是| D[平行趋势假设可接受]&#10;    C --&gt;|否| E[重新配对或换单元&lt;br/&gt;不要继续]&#10;    D --&gt; F[执行实验 4-8 周]&#10;    F --&gt; G[差分估计 + 置信区间]&#10;    G --&gt; H{置信区间是否排除 0?}&#10;    H --&gt;|是| I[得到显著增量]&#10;    H --&gt;|否| J[效应不显著&lt;br/&gt;扩大规模或延长周期后重做]\">flowchart LR\n    A[实验前 4-8 周] --&gt; B[画两组曲线]\n    B --&gt; C{曲线平行?}\n    C --&gt;|是| D[平行趋势假设可接受]\n    C --&gt;|否| E[重新配对或换单元&lt;br/&gt;不要继续]\n    D --&gt; F[执行实验 4-8 周]\n    F --&gt; G[差分估计 + 置信区间]\n    G --&gt; H{置信区间是否排除 0?}\n    H --&gt;|是| I[得到显著增量]\n    H --&gt;|否| J[效应不显著&lt;br/&gt;扩大规模或延长周期后重做]</pre><p><strong>置信区间与统计功效必须事先算。</strong> 地理单元数量少时功效很低：如果只有 8 个区域、对照组 2 个，那么随机指派带来的方差会大到几乎检测不出中等效应。在实验开始前用历史数据做功效分析（估算方差、目标效应大小、所需周期）是必要步骤，否则很可能花八周时间得到一个&quot;不显著&quot;的结论——而不显著不等于没有效应，只是没测出来。</p>\n<p>更稳健的做法是用回归形式做估计，控制实验前基线与其他协变量：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Y</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>α</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>β</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mtext>Treat</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mtext>Post</mtext><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>γ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>ε</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Y_{it} = \\alpha + \\beta \\cdot \\text{Treat}_i \\cdot \\text{Post}_t + \\gamma_i + \\delta_t + \\varepsilon_{it}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Treat</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Post</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0556em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0379em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>γ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\gamma_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0556em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是地理单元固定效应，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0379em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是时间固定效应。这个设定比简单差分更能吸收单元间与时期间的系统差异，是实践中的标准做法。</p>\n<h2 id=\"失效模式-什么时候结论是错的\">失效模式：什么时候结论是错的</h2><p>geo holdout 有一组特定的失效方式，知道它们比知道方法本身更重要。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>失效模式</th>\n<th>机制</th>\n<th>识别</th>\n<th>缓解</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>平行趋势不成立</td>\n<td>两组基线本就不同</td>\n<td>实验前曲线发散</td>\n<td>严格配对；实验前做检验</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>溢出效应</td>\n<td>邻近区域用户跨区购买/物流覆盖</td>\n<td>对照组出现异常上升</td>\n<td>地理上隔离处理组与对照组</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>预算再分配</td>\n<td>平台把停投区域的预算自动挪到别处</td>\n<td>处理组之外的区域也变化</td>\n<td>关闭平台的自动预算再分配</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>学习期污染</td>\n<td>停投后平台算法仍在优化</td>\n<td>前 1–2 周数据异常</td>\n<td>剔除实验前 1–2 周数据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>外部冲击</td>\n<td>大促、竞品动作、汇率、政策</td>\n<td>两组同向大幅波动</td>\n<td>避免大促期；记录外部事件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>样本量不足</td>\n<td>单元少、方差大</td>\n<td>置信区间极宽</td>\n<td>事先功效分析；延长周期</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>需求延迟</td>\n<td>短期停投被延迟需求掩盖</td>\n<td>实验后出现反弹</td>\n<td>观察实验后 2–4 周的滞后效应</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>溢出效应是跨境场景里最需要警惕的一条。</strong> 如果处理组和对照组是相邻的州或城市，用户可能跨区购买（物流地址与浏览地不同），或者平台的投放算法把两个区域视为一个整体。缓解办法是选择地理上或物流上隔离的单元，并在分析时检查对照组是否出现异常上升。</p>\n<p><strong>需求延迟（也称&quot;蓄水池效应&quot;）也常被忽略。</strong> 停投两三周后，一部分被抑制的需求并没有消失，只是推迟到实验结束后释放。看到实验后处理组反弹，会让人误以为实验期测到的下降是假的。正确的做法是<strong>在实验后继续观察 2–4 周</strong>，把这段滞后期的效应计入增量计算，或者把周期设计得足够长以让需求充分释放。</p>\n<h2 id=\"从增量到决策\">从增量到决策</h2><p>实验给出增量新客数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mtext>inc</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N_{\\text{inc}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">inc</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 与渠道成本 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span>，则：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>iCAC</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>C</mi><msub><mi>N</mi><mtext>inc</mtext></msub></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mtext>虚高系数</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mtext>iCAC</mtext><msub><mtext>CAC</mtext><mtext>归因</mtext></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{iCAC} = \\frac{C}{N_{\\text{inc}}}, \\qquad \\text{虚高系数} = \\frac{\\text{iCAC}}{\\text{CAC}_{\\text{归因}}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">iCAC</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1963em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">inc</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">虚高系数</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1963em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CAC</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">归因</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">iCAC</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这个虚高系数就是给归因口径做校准的乘数。它的应用方式是：把归因口径下每个渠道的新客数除以对应的虚高系数，得到校准后的贡献，再据此做预算分配。注意<strong>虚高系数只对做过实验的渠道有效</strong>，未实验渠道只能沿用相近渠道的系数或保守估计。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>实验设计调整</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>渠道预算小、效应小</td>\n<td>用降投而非停投，延长周期</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可选市场少</td>\n<td>配对设计 + 跨渠道合并测试</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>强季节性强</td>\n<td>避开大促，或使用同期多市场对照</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>高退货 / COD 市场</td>\n<td>以签收为最终指标，延长观察窗口</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>品牌类投放</td>\n<td>以品牌搜索量与自然访问作为辅助指标</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>最后一条值得展开：品牌展示类渠道的直接转化增量小，但它的作用可能体现在品牌搜索量上。这类实验的指标应该扩展为&quot;品牌搜索量 + 自然访问量 + 直接访问量&quot;的组合，否则会系统性地低估其价值。这与浏览归因的处理逻辑一致，见<a href=\"../attribution-model/view-through-attrib\">展示型广告的浏览归因</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>geo holdout 是在平台约束下唯一能真正制造反事实的方法，用地理单元代替用户做随机化。</li>\n<li>五个必须做对的决策：单元粒度、对照组规模（10–20%）、匹配方式（配对或分层随机）、周期（最低 4 周、常见 6–8 周）、处理强度（跨境常见降到 10–20%）。</li>\n<li>估计用差分中的差分或固定效应回归；核心假设是平行趋势，必须用实验前曲线做间接验证；事先必须做功效分析。</li>\n<li>主要失效模式是平行趋势不成立、溢出效应、平台预算再分配、学习期污染、外部冲击、样本量不足、需求延迟；跨境场景最需警惕溢出与需求延迟。</li>\n<li>虚高系数 = iCAC / 归因 CAC，用于校准归因口径的渠道贡献，但只对做过实验的渠道有效。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这套方法在有若干成熟市场、有历史数据可比时工作良好。但如果要评估的是一个全新市场的冷启投放，历史数据、可比市场、稳定基线全都不存在，需要一套针对性的调整——见<a href=\"market-entry-attribution\">新市场冷启获客归因</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"geo holdout 衡量渠道增量","id":"geo-holdout-衡量渠道增量"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：为什么必须是地理分区","id":"核心概念-为什么必须是地理分区"},{"level":2,"text":"设计：五个必须做对的决策","id":"设计-五个必须做对的决策"},{"level":2,"text":"估计：差分与它的假设","id":"估计-差分与它的假设"},{"level":2,"text":"失效模式：什么时候结论是错的","id":"失效模式-什么时候结论是错的"},{"level":2,"text":"从增量到决策","id":"从增量到决策"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"增量获客 vs 自然本会买","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/global-user-growth-attribution/incremental-growth/incremental-acquisition"},"next":{"title":"新市场冷启获客归因","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/global-user-growth-attribution/incremental-growth/market-entry-attribution"}}